WEBVTT

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:10.480
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> Cappuccino, please.

00:00:10.993 --> 00:00:11.866
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> What’s your name?

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:12.655
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> Helen.

00:00:13.664 --> 00:00:14.210
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> Ellen?

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:15.868
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> No, Helen.

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.129
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> Helen. OK.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.304
<v><b>Barista 2:</b></v> Are you Diana?

00:00:27.913 --> 00:00:30.246
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> No, I’m not. I’m Helen.

00:00:30.883 --> 00:00:38.432
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> Sorry. Helen. Your cappuccino.

00:00:38.785 --> 00:00:39.320
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> Thanks.

00:00:50.546 --> 00:00:52.439
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Hello. Are you Helen?

00:00:52.613 --> 00:00:55.260
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> Yes, I am. And you’re Tom.

00:00:55.434 --> 00:00:57.309
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Yes! Nice to meet you.

00:00:57.567 --> 00:00:58.519
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> Nice to meet you.

00:00:59.179 --> 00:01:00.099
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Just a minute.

00:01:07.872 --> 00:01:10.240
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Hi. A tea, please.

00:01:11.675 --> 00:01:12.488
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> What’s your name?

00:01:13.226 --> 00:01:13.760
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Tom.

00:01:14.392 --> 00:01:16.080
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> Dom.

00:01:16.101 --> 00:01:17.909
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> No, I’m Tom, not Dom.

00:01:18.309 --> 00:01:19.902
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> Sorry.